  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV Epidemic Control</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Its main purpose is to facilitate a forum for its member institutions to engage in the developmentof the country through peace building and other development activities. IRCE targets in bringingreligious leaders and institutions of various faiths at national and regional levels to identify potential on building trust and relationship among the various religious communities. IRCEcurrently implements various development activities including Peace Building, Prevention andMitigation of Harmful Traditional Practices, Gender Inclusiveness and PEPFAR Faith Based ART Retention and Adherence Initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
